                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Do I need PhotoDNA integration?</h3>
                                        <p>For any platform handling user-uploaded images: yes. Standard integration with NCMEC (US) + IWF (UK). Not optional.</p>
                                        <h3>Hive vs Sightengine vs custom?</h3>
                                        <p>Hive for general moderation at scale. Sightengine for narrower use cases. Custom for platform-specific needs at very high volume.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the DSA impact?</h3>
                                        <p>For platforms serving EU users: mandatory transparency reports, appeal process, risk assessments (VLOPs), user notification of decisions.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I handle moderator wellness?</h3>
                                        <p>Rotate work, provide mental health support, mandatory breaks, AI pre-filtering to reduce human exposure to the worst content. Non-negotiable ethical requirement.</p>
